=== LIN vs SQLITE TRANSACTION BENCHMARKS ===
--- 1. In-Memory Tiny Transaction (1 write per tx, 2,000 iterations) ---
Lin (dynamic AST):    2240 ns/tx  (446429 tx/sec)
SQLite (params):      2170 ns/tx  (460829 tx/sec)

--- 2. In-Memory Multi-Write Transaction (10 writes per tx, 1,000 transactions) ---
Lin:     22317 ns/tx  (44809 tx/sec, 448089 ops/sec)
SQLite:  10247 ns/tx  (97590 tx/sec, 975895 ops/sec)

--- 3. In-Memory Transaction Rollback (10 writes per tx, rolled back) ---
Lin:     23922 ns/tx  (41803 tx/sec)
SQLite:   8711 ns/tx  (114797 tx/sec)

--- 4. Interactive Bank Transfer (Read -> Validate -> 2 Updates -> Commit) ---
Lin:       835 ns/tx  (1197605 tx/sec)
SQLite:   1044 ns/tx  (957854 tx/sec)

--- 5. Durable Disk WAL Transactions (5 writes per tx, 1,000 transactions, WAL on disk) ---
Lin (WAL SyncMode::Normal): 642081 ns/tx  (1557 tx/sec, 7787 ops/sec)
SQLite (WAL sync=NORMAL):    18212 ns/tx  (54909 tx/sec, 274544 ops/sec)
